@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create (change SKU before repeating)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"GO-BOOK-01","name":"หนังสือ Go","price_satang":25000}

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?limit=20&offset=0

### Get (replace 1 with the ID returned by Create)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### Replace all writable fields
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"GO-BOOK-01","name":"หนังสือ Go ฉบับปรับปรุง","price_satang":29000}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/1
